Review the distinct completed foreground Profile sessions recorded by self-improvement. Follow the
Curator skill: use source session evidence, call native memory_write only for concise durable
entries prefixed [learned], and create or patch only Curator-managed Profile-local skill-only
packages after recurrence across distinct sessions. After creating a package, use `ziggy extensions
add . <id>` so it is admitted after restart. Log an applied or no-op decision with
self_improvement_log, and clear readiness only after the review succeeds. Do not modify repository,
catalogue, human-owned, external, or pinned packages.
